1
00:00:00,813 --> 00:00:03,483
- Hey, guys.
LEONARD & SHELDON: Hello.

2
00:00:03,816 --> 00:00:05,106
(Penny:)It's a little loud.

3
00:00:05,276 --> 00:00:07,486
(Howard:)No problem. Turning it down.

4
00:00:07,653 --> 00:00:10,823
San Francisco, Lisbon, Halifax:

5
00:00:10,990 --> 00:00:12,410
Voilà.

6
00:00:12,575 --> 00:00:13,615
(Penny:)Okay, thanks.

7
00:00:13,785 --> 00:00:16,285
(Leonard:)Hang on, hang on.
Do you not realize what we just did?

8
00:00:16,537 --> 00:00:18,877
(Penny:)Yeah, you turned your stereo down
with your laptop.

9
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:23,960
(Sheldon:)No, we turned our stereo down by sending
a signal around the world via the Internet.

10
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:27,300
Oh. Get one of those
universal remotes at RadioShack.

11
00:00:27,465 --> 00:00:29,045
(Penny:)They're really cheap.

12
00:00:29,217 --> 00:00:30,927
(Leonard:)No. You don't get it.

13
00:00:31,094 --> 00:00:33,634
(Leonard:)Howard, enable public access.

14
00:00:33,805 --> 00:00:35,305
(Howard:)Public access enabled.

15
00:00:39,018 --> 00:00:41,558
- Boy, that's terrific, but I'll see you.
- No, hang on.

16
00:00:43,731 --> 00:00:44,771
[ALL GASP]

17
00:00:44,941 --> 00:00:46,071
See?

18
00:00:47,235 --> 00:00:48,695
(Howard:)No.

19
00:00:48,861 --> 00:00:51,151
Someone in Sichuan Province, China...

20
00:00:51,322 --> 00:00:55,072
(Sheldon:)...is using his computer
to turn our lights on and off.

21
00:00:55,618 --> 00:00:57,578
(Penny:)Huh. Well, that's handy.

22
00:00:58,746 --> 00:01:00,706
(Penny:)Um, here's a question. Why?

23
00:01:02,291 --> 00:01:03,961
ALL:
Because we can.

24
00:01:04,710 --> 00:01:07,090
Oh! They found the remote-control cars.

25
00:01:10,341 --> 00:01:13,761
- But wait, wait, what's on top of them?
- Wireless webcams. Wave hello.

26
00:01:14,554 --> 00:01:17,224
(Howard:)The monster truck
is out of Austin, Texas...

27
00:01:17,390 --> 00:01:21,270
(Howard:)...and the blue Viper is being operated
from suburban Tel Aviv.

28
00:01:23,688 --> 00:01:25,608
You may wanna put on slacks.

29
00:01:25,773 --> 00:01:27,063
(Penny:)What?

30
00:01:28,943 --> 00:01:33,113
Ew! Stop it. No. Leave me alone.

31
00:01:34,198 --> 00:01:35,368
[DOOR SLAMS]

32
00:01:35,575 --> 00:01:39,035
- Who's running the red Corvette?
- That would be me.

